  "question": {
    "text": "The weight of a body at the surface of earth is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. The weight of the body at an altitude of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math> above the earth&#39;s surface is (given, radius of earth <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math>)"
